Cloth store static web page

1. Search Functionality: Added an input field in the header for searching products. The `searchProducts` function filters the products based on the input value.

2. Product Details Modal: Clicking on a product image now triggers a modal that displays more details about the product. The `showDetails` function sets the content of the modal and displays it. The `closeModal` function hides the modal when the close button is clicked or when clicking outside the modal content.

3. Responsive Design: Adjusted the CSS to ensure the layout is more responsive and looks good on smaller screens.

You can expand on this template by adding more products, improving styling, or integrating with a backend to dynamically fetch and display products.
